OL,3,GNEWSA'Everyone in the Big Brother house
OL,4,Awas just crying'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old Big Brother contestant
OL,7,Fsays she achieved her dream - but
OL,8,Fappearing on the show was a challenging
OL,9,Fexperience.
OL,11,FCharlotte Nott, who lost parts of her
OL,12,Farms and legs to meningitis when she
OL,13,Fwas two, made a memorable entrance to
OL,14,Fthe house when she removed her
OL,15,Fprosthetic legs after breaking her shoe
OL,16,Fwhile stepping on to the stage.
OL,18,FBut after 13 days, Nott, from Oxford,
OL,19,Fmade the decision to leave after
OL,20,Freaching her "breaking point".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
